= Instance Migration =

To migrate a single instance (default: pki-tomcat):

<pre>
$ pki-server migrate [-i <instance ID>] --tomcat <version>
-----------------
Instance migrated
-----------------
</pre>

= System Migration =

To migrate all instances:

<pre>
$ pki-server migrate --all --tomcat <version>
---------------
System migrated
---------------
</pre>

